+	OnDisc, on the visible disc) that is not counting for them: contested (two or more players inside) or their own zone
+	held alone. Contested wins over held, then the lower Id, so the pick never depends on table order. Returns
+	(runtime, contested, held) or nil. ]]
+local function standingZoneOf(player: Player): (TerritoryRuntime?, boolean, boolean)
